        "text_preview": "\n(By Sri. Srinivasa D C, Advocate)\nAnd:\nSmt. Teena Appaiah K\nW/O Appaiah\nAged About 35 Years\nResident Of Athur Village And Post\nGonikoppal, Virajpet Taluk\nKodagu District - 571 213\n .....Respondent\n(By Sri. Harish Ganapathi, Advocate)\n This"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "163041c47684493ea8159f7e588dd6f8_14",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The Sessions Court dismissed the appeal filed by CRL.RP NO.1319 OF 2021 the respondent No.1 and thereby confirming the order passed by the trial Court."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c70a966320554b90ae8e42bcc2bddae5_26",
        "summary_section": "arguments",
        "labels": [
          "ARG_RESPONDENT"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "explicit_leakage_phrase"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [
          {
            "pattern": "\\bset\\s+aside\\b",
            "matched_text": "set aside",
            "start": 195,
            "end": 204
          }
        ],
        "text_preview": "\n6. Petitioner/wife has filed the petition contending that the order of the trial Court so far as refusing to order for return of gold ornaments is concerned, is not sustainable and liable to be set aside."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "4b4e1f3de74c44f99afd20d5357ef022_57",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Vide impugned order dated 30.06.2018, the trial Court partly allowed the petition granting maintenance at the rate of Rs.15,000/- p.m. with 5% yearly enhancement, cost of Rs.5,000/-,\ndamages in a sum of Rs.2,00,000/- for misappropriation of"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "6e98a1bb8933435086b9fd6a1b7279ca_58",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The trial Court has also restrained the respondents from committing any act of domestic violence against the petitioner."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "548de41c21694b938ccc50f44a4a17a3_59",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "13. It is pertinent to note that petitioner did not challenge this order passed by the trial Court."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b545961ad68b4d989538219e1a0a1227_62",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "So far as the grievance of the respondent No.1 is concerned, having regard to the fact that the relationship between the parties not in dispute and the petitioner and respondent No.1 are not living Smt.Teena Appaiah K.C vs Sri.K.K.Appaiah o"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "da8300ea7ef94d769add29b47db38058_63",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Respondents are owning properties as reflected in Ex.P4 to 16."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d1f25146f00740f5bfbdf50945fd3f6d_64",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Respondent No.1 has produced a partition deed at Ex.R1."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "206a00c692ab427c84d82384563bfe06_65",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "From the contents of the document, it is evident that in lieu of his share in respect of valuable properties, he has CRL.RP NO.1319 OF 2021 taken only a paltry sum of Rs.15 lakhs to his share."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "1a5256b3f8a747fc87354dd14c71fb97_66",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It goes without saying that in order to prevent the petitioner from claiming any right over the property that may fall to the share of respondent No.1, the respondent No.1 appears to have brought this document into existence."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "924681c8e5fd492f93533468a95ff635_67",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "17. During the course of her evidence, the petitioner has deposed that respondent No.1 is getting income of Rs.60 to 70 lakhs p.a."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2529f5c25955402689e3ed358da96fcb_68",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "This piece of evidence of petitioner is not disputed by the respondents, more particularly respondent No.1 has not come up with any specific figure regarding the income derived from the said properties."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c926c649c6e64d3a94d7c837f9c3e6b2_69",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Taking to consideration the extent, nature of the lands owned by the respondents and the expected income that may be derived from the said properties and share of the respondent No.1, the trial Court has come to correct conclusion so far as"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "18f9b9ba879a446d8f77cc71aba51d60_70",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The Sessions Court also on re-appreciation of oral and documentary evidence has refused to interfere with the said findings."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "bb827291976f4e65ba2b25d1fde0dcdc_71",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nCRL.RP NO.1319 OF 2021"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3f44a9c8873a4577a7e5c58097549929_72",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "This Court also find no justifiable grounds to interfere with the same."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f537ba6aaf344ab6b3fab46593bfd2ba_73",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "18. So far as the petition filed by the petitioner is concerned, as rightly observed by the trial Court,\nexcept listing the ornaments, the petitioner has not come up with any pleadings or averments as to how she parted with possession of th"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0958e3ab0f244489a8184c9dd1b2cb65_74",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "For the first time in the synopsis to the petition, the petitioner has pleaded that during the time of happy married life, respondent No.1 took all the jewels from the custody of petitioner with the promise to keep in safety locker and misu"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "30f2ebe06fd94e5c873b3bc79c488dc0_75",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Consequently, there is also no evidence as to what are all the ornaments which were pledged or sold by the respondent No.1."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7069b95cdc1b41ce9c8f60ef3a283c6e_76",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Only during the course of evidence she has produced receipts regarding pledging and sale of certain ornaments."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9914457f4e7a4ec6830ded9afbe03fd7_77",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "19. Though respondent No.1 has not disputed pledging/sale of certain ornaments, he has specifically claimed that they belong to his mother."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ed8d674ce4e94b49b2cba59e668c40e2_78",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "As rightly CRL.RP NO.1319 OF 2021 observed by the trial Court, except Ex.P 21 to 25, the other jewellery bills doesn't contain the TIN Number and Serial number/Bill number and expressed doubt with regard to their authenticity."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "60d04334936f438b97c8cbe88199e29e_79",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The other bills may prove the fact that through them petitioner has purchased certain ornaments."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "16fe27d0bab24386964871efaca2c1a3_80",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However, by itself it cannot be held that the said ornaments were given by petitioner to the respondent No.1 and he has pledged/sold them."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "1b137db6406e4d39872d2be3ac37f990_81",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The receipts produced by the petitioner is not sufficient to hold that the pledged/sold ornaments were purchased through the said receipts."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "16333b58307c4f4ea9deab045db88dc5_82",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Therefore, the trial Court has rightly refused to order for returning of the said ornaments."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "06ca37f287f64e739f08c780994c3ad5_83",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "20. However, since the respondent No.1 has admitted that he is yet to return 8 sovereign gold ornaments, the trial Court has rightly ordered for payment of value of the same and quantified it at Rs.2 lakhs."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "84000d2e0b52409fb4690d71e8536434_84",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However, though the order is passed on 30.06.2018, the respondent No.1 has not yet paid the said amount."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "51ce72efa4d24f01a5bc8f52113084e9_85",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Having regard to the fact that the value of CRL.RP NO.1319 OF 2021 gold is increasing day by day, the respondent is required to pay the value of 8 sovereign of 22 carat gold as Smt.Teena Appaiah K.C vs Sri.K.K.Appaiah on 20 January, 2024 In"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0440b52436644543a7521b339c40f3a2_86",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "To this extent, the order is liable to be modified and accordingly the following:\nORDER (i) Petition filed by the respondent No.1/husband i.e., Crl.RP.No.1319/2021, is dismissed."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "867ebc4fe8da4dc084b39edef08fca3d_87",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n(ii) The petition filed by the petitioner/wife i.e., Crl.RP.No.1270/2021, is allowed in part."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "fc055a3e839e4b65a5a36ad174473858_88",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n(iii) The impugned judgment and order of the trial Court is confirmed except with regard to payment of Rs.2 lakhs in respect of misappropriation of 8 sovereign of gold."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "cdcfac09b74a4d4ebc992bc9b0d816ab_89",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nInstead of Rs.2 lakhs the respondent No.1 shall pay the actual value of 8 sovereign of 22 carat gold to the petitioner as on the date of payment."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "32b9de644da94a7193acb7ab2e880a7e_90",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The remaining order is confirmed."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "919fec07e6064acb832225e4d78694d1_91",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n(iv) The Registry is directed to send back the trial Court and Sessions Court records along with copy of this order forthwith."
      }
